Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.64,0:00:06.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is Trigun.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.72,0:00:33.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.88,0:01:43.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, Master, I am eminently aware of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.86,0:01:47.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me teach him that to\Nstay alive is true suffering.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.58,0:01:53.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For all eternity he will pay for\Nthe grievous sin of injuring you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.56,0:01:59.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He will suffer unceasing despair,\Nanguish, wounds which can never be healed.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.14,0:02:07.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A wonderful show is about to begin and\Nyou will perform as the star attraction,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.28,0:02:09.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vash the Stampede.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.34,0:02:21.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Three demons?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.84,0:02:23.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Three demons are here?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.86,0:02:29.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, this is your comeback\Ncelebration, Vash the Stampede.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.00,0:02:37.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh man, what is that thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.24,0:02:38.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, hello there!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.64,0:02:40.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Apparently, you're from the outside world.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.00,0:02:42.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're peaceful people.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.24,0:02:43.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't want any trouble with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.70,0:02:45.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, if you please don't...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.72,0:02:55.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.10,0:02:56.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's just lying there.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.76,0:02:57.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's he doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.22,0:02:59.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.13,0:02:59.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.56,0:03:13.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You seem surprised.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.10,0:03:16.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should know this\Nship is easy prey for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.52,0:03:22.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The next few moments are likely to be the\Nmost fulfilling you have ever experienced.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.34,0:03:27.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Temper, temper.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.48,0:03:31.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your excitable nature will\Nwork nicely for our game.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.22,0:03:34.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What now?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.64,0:03:36.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alright, what's the situation, Doc?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.12,0:03:41.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Vash, intruders are approaching\Nfrom both sides of the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.50,0:03:45.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid the ones who went to check\Nit out have stopped reporting in.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.82,0:03:49.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna do this my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.00,0:03:53.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, word to the wise.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.94,0:03:56.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're not dealing with\Ntypical human beings here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.36,0:03:58.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you try pulling the\Nsame stunt as before,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.38,0:04:01.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guarantee you they will\Ndestroy you this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.28,0:04:08.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go stay with the doctor\Nuntil this is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.24,0:04:09.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.15,0:04:10.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mind telling me what\Nthe hell these things are?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.82,0:04:11.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cuz you're the one.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.73,0:04:13.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We should blame for this!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.96,0:04:14.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get moving!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.42,0:04:38.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn, how many of these\Nthings do I have to shoot?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.90,0:04:40.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm wasting bullets.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.68,0:04:42.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.86,0:04:44.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where's the man behind the curtain?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.18,0:05:06.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A kick from this thing is too strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.44,0:05:11.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Concentrate.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.88,0:05:18.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not about to trust you to\Ndo everything around this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.18,0:05:21.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is definitely not good.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.12,0:05:24.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're going after the power plant.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.10,0:05:25.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are they doing that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.32,0:05:27.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are they trying to make\Nit and crash the ship?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.42,0:05:29.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Flash is now our only hope against them.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.94,0:05:31.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everything now depends upon his success,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.84,0:05:35.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,along with the help and strength\Nof the creature in black.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.52,0:05:45.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm amazed that a guy as big as you\Nare actually managed to get this far.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.70,0:05:52.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.61,0:05:54.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, nice of you to pop in.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.32,0:05:57.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I believe you'll be a worthy\Nopponent. Hello there!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.64,0:05:59.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you even understand\Nthe word I'm saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.66,0:06:00.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alright!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.57,0:06:01.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can take off right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.84,0:06:02.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's your last chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.76,0:06:04.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.48,0:06:05.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will show no mercy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.94,0:06:08.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.94,0:06:15.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, that was an interesting display.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.62,0:06:16.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, try this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.28,0:06:20.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Say goodnight.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.94,0:06:33.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think that's most of them. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.70,0:06:35.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vash!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.94,0:06:38.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One of the demons is heading\Nfor power room number two.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.98,0:06:41.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're going to try\Nto bring down the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.44,0:06:43.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That power room is six floors below us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.60,0:06:46.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll never make it all the\Nway down in time to stop him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.76,0:06:48.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what the hell do\Nyou think you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.58,0:06:50.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm making myself a little shortcut.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.30,0:06:56.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.28,0:07:00.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that I actually stopped to think\Nabout it, this is really kind of...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.86,0:07:04.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.58,0:07:21.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, this is a new model, alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.18,0:07:23.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pack's a pretty powerful punch. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.70,0:07:37.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, my friends can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.02,0:07:46.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Val, Jones, Lumira, Farina.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.48,0:07:51.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I remember you, I remember all of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.02,0:07:53.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never forgotten you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.86,0:07:59.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry I didn't come\Nhome sooner. I'm...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.30,0:08:00.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.06,0:08:17.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't make me laugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.12,0:08:19.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you crying for?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.84,0:08:22.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This only happened because\Nyou're here, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.08,0:08:28.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am the third gung-ho gun,\Nwho parted the gauntlet.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.24,0:08:30.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me why!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.44,0:08:31.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why did you have to kill him?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.98,0:08:34.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why would you even want\Nto do something like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.86,0:08:37.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's simple, because\Nyou are Vash the Stampede.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.40,0:08:44.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Compared to what you did to July and\NAugusta, this is a stroll through the tulips.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.84,0:08:47.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You shouldn't even be on this planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.54,0:08:51.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In fact, that's why I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.66,0:08:54.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to crush you\Nwith my Poo Terrier.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.64,0:09:08.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, how'd that feel?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.04,0:09:14.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It didn't make a dent.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.30,0:09:17.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.21,0:09:19.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You must be Gray the Nine Lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.48,0:09:22.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't exactly say I'm happy to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.40,0:09:24.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess the rumor of the man\Nwith the nine extra lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.48,0:09:26.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Actually had some truth to it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.02,0:09:43.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.06,0:09:46.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why'd you have to do that, you big dumb?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.32,0:09:47.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.80,0:09:53.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.72,0:09:55.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can this get any worse?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.26,0:10:13.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The weird contradict is derived from\Na battlefield situation when a great
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.22,0:10:17.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,spear and a great shield were pitted\Nagainst each other and both broke.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.90,0:10:20.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The difference here is that\Nmy shield is invincible.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.22,0:10:23.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It will repel any kind of attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.52,0:10:25.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, let's give it a try.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.62,0:10:36.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is what's always a waste of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.12,0:10:39.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing can contradict my co-terrier.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.14,0:10:47.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have only three important\Nwords in my vocabulary.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.64,0:10:50.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Attack, trample, and destroy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.82,0:10:53.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These describe what you've\Nbeen doing all this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.56,0:10:56.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vash the Stampede.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.64,0:11:14.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No! Yaaaargh!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.22,0:11:21.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ugh!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.96,0:11:22.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.04,0:11:23.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ough!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.95,0:11:24.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ough!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.94,0:11:28.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,isn't that it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.46,0:11:39.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.78,0:12:01.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.32,0:12:03.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That explains your invulnerability.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.78,0:12:05.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This simplifies matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.38,0:12:22.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, stop shooting!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.92,0:12:24.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.34,0:12:26.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keep on hollering and\Nmaking those stupid faces.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.66,0:12:28.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't get enough of it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.02,0:12:32.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is it so much to ask?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.84,0:12:34.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've cost enough damage.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.24,0:12:35.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't you leave them alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.38,0:12:41.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you telling me that I\Nhad this done to my body just
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.22,0:12:44.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so I could listen to your\Npathetic bleeding-heart nonsense?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.16,0:12:47.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're crazier than they told me you were!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.82,0:12:52.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to polarize you and\Nthe ship into tiny little pieces!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.12,0:13:01.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Must keep moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.72,0:13:02.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I promised her.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.20,0:13:04.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I must keep moving!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.92,0:13:21.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's got one of fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.02,0:13:35.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, snap out of it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.96,0:13:37.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The plant!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.44,0:13:39.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.88,0:13:45.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.80,0:13:57.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.20,0:14:04.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn, you're a persistent bugger.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.78,0:14:06.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Enough ammo!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.04,0:14:10.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not good.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.30,0:14:13.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That thing's way too close to the plant.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.24,0:14:19.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.72,0:14:20.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.40,0:14:41.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Meryl, I think it\Nfinally stopped. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.32,0:14:48.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, what in the world is that? It's?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.94,0:14:55.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Plant number one is down.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.72,0:15:06.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The plant is shutting down!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.52,0:15:08.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is our city gonna fall?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.82,0:15:11.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just not fair. Why now?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.14,0:15:14.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why in the hell is all of this happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.38,0:15:16.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's nuts. Until yesterday,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.46,0:15:21.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,my biggest problem was figuring out how\Nto get the girl I love to look my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.42,0:15:23.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you giving up already?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.84,0:15:27.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's too soon to give up!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.20,0:15:30.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's always a solution if\Nyou're willing to look for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.90,0:15:32.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We haven't tried everything yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.42,0:15:34.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you just gonna roll over and die?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.40,0:15:36.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cause if you wanna live, think!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.42,0:15:38.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Think of what you should be doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.30,0:15:42.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can operate the controller, can't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.32,0:15:44.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, can't you? Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.74,0:15:48.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.65,0:15:49.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then there's still time.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.57,0:15:50.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Still time.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.54,0:15:55.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm in. Can you do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.38,0:15:58.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Answer me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.16,0:16:04.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on now, friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.14,0:16:05.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not over just yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.92,0:16:07.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on just a little bit longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.30,0:16:09.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can help you if you're\Nwilling to give it a try.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.86,0:16:10.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know we can do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.06,0:16:12.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.70,0:16:34.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.72,0:16:41.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What? What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.10,0:16:44.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.00,0:16:45.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The plant!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.08,0:16:47.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's coming back to life!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.60,0:16:48.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.51,0:16:49.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The power levels are rising.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.86,0:16:51.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're going to make it after all!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.26,0:17:00.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.44,0:17:01.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take it nice and easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.76,0:17:09.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a once that live outside of
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.48,0:17:15.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,time and will flash the stampede!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.64,0:17:16.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.56,0:18:04.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it, everything happened\Nexactly the way they did.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.20,0:18:08.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No matter what you say, it's\Nnot gonna change anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.84,0:18:10.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You better get used to\Nthe idea that someday
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.06,0:18:13.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you're gonna all live\Non that desert planet!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.48,0:18:19.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew that it was inevitable, but I never\Nthought I would be the one to trigger it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.12,0:18:24.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My God!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.14,0:18:26.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.74,0:18:30.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh no, you mean the girl we saved is...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.48,0:18:32.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.42,0:18:34.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're done for.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.30,0:18:35.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're stuck on this planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.28,0:18:37.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Away from life.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.56,0:18:39.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our peaceful days are over.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.62,0:18:42.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn, how does this happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.40,0:18:44.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Vash.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.26,0:18:48.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is all his fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.34,0:18:50.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right, it's his fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.12,0:18:53.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, everything was\Nfine before he came back.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.60,0:18:58.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.92,0:19:00.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think that'll make it better?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.66,0:19:01.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All of you, shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.12,0:19:06.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This wasn't because of him!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.14,0:19:08.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's our fault!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.46,0:19:12.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We all chose to ignore reality when\Nwe knew what would happen someday!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.54,0:19:16.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We never lifted a finger to help, so\Nwe have no right to point one now!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.98,0:19:20.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We just huddled together, shaking\Nin fear like scared animals!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.42,0:19:24.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're still alive, and\Nthat's what matters!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.36,0:19:28.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we can work together, we can build\Na decent life on this ball of sand!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.58,0:19:31.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Brad.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.34,0:19:33.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vash!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.72,0:19:38.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vash! Jessica. You're all right.\NWhat a relief. That reminds me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.68,0:19:40.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I never thanked you for\Nthe new coat, did I?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.52,0:19:41.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.43,0:19:42.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It fits me like a glove.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.02,0:19:43.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.93,0:19:45.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looks really good on you, Vash.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.20,0:19:47.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She doesn't seem upset\Nabout the ship at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.48,0:19:49.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gee, she's a tough cookie.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.14,0:19:51.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Needle Noggin!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.52,0:19:53.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.82,0:20:02.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.86,0:20:10.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.94,0:20:13.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh! Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.06,0:20:16.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Brad!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.46,0:20:17.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Brad, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.52,0:20:19.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,BRAD!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.38,0:20:26.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have failed.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.50,0:20:30.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I do not understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.76,0:20:32.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was a perfect plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.48,0:20:37.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You depraved lunatic!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.12,0:20:53.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This damn job's killing me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.96,0:21:03.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you actually crying, Ash the Stampede?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.08,0:21:06.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is wonderful, truly wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.04,0:21:17.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Brad!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.12,0:21:20.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Brad!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.34,0:21:21.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hang on, Brad!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.48,0:21:27.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Brad!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.32,0:21:49.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The ones who live outside of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.66,0:21:51.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It really is amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.84,0:21:54.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My hands grew this big in 13 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.90,0:21:57.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you haven't changed a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.84,0:22:00.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're exactly as I remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.48,0:22:16.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Brad! Brad!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.58,0:22:29.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,ETERNAL PAIN
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.56,0:23:11.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.96,0:23:13.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.36,0:23:20.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.10,0:23:24.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,much for watching.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.90,0:23:28.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's nothing else I need.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.90,0:23:32.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't see the smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.90,0:23:45.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.02,0:23:48.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Never lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.30,0:23:52.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Na, na, na, na.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.02,0:23:58.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Na, na, na, na, na.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.72,0:24:05.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Na, na, na, na.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.20,0:24:10.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Self-protection, the means\Nof protecting oneself.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.14,0:24:13.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,People expose the\Nweaknesses which pain them.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.50,0:24:14.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and thus form a group.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.62,0:24:19.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Before they know it, they begin to\Nexclude those who are not one of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.24,0:24:22.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But what becomes of those\Nwho have been excluded?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.54,0:24:27.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I smiled at the children who lived in\Na tight group, in their rickety house.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.48,0:24:32.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure, let's live today, let's live\Ntomorrow, and let's live the day after that,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.06,0:24:35.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,even if it means living in eternal pain.

